Extend! Extend!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.100
That girl's true form must be that of a demon!

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.390
What the hell is that...?!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.100
Those assholes are really noisy.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.190
I bet they don't understand a thing about my delicate acting.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.570
Spellman, this is superb!

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:28.860
You haven't seen anything yet, Ms. President.

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:32.900
Still to come is Krauser-san's ad-lib, as well as the parts where I added the finishing touches!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.280
This is where all my efforts come to a glorious fruition!

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.200
I'm sorry...

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.870
Catching a cold when your...

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.830
horn's in such a state...

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.740
It's okay. Just eat your congee.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.540
Now, open up.

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:45.920
What is this grotesque sound I'm hearing?

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.250
Maybe the sound system's broken.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.460
Takeshi...

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:49.380
Yuko...

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.750
Wait, could this be...?!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.710
No fucking way!

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:53.880
They used this scene after all...!

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:54.720
Look!

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:55.930
It is true!

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:59.470
All the evil in the entire world is slowly being channeled into Krauser-san...

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.890
It's the "Demon Jewel!"

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:06.940
Fuck yeah!

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:08.110
It's in!

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.280
This feels weird...

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:13.110
Director, stop this scene for a minute!

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.320
Who the hell does this guy think he is?!

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:15.450
...this spring season!

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:15.950
What?!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:19.070
This is the part when I stopped the scene and that guy said his lame ad-lib!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.580
What is this...?

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:21.740
What's going on?!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.660
What's up with this congee anyways?
It feels kinda squishy, but kinda thick.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.830
And my clothes are all sticky now!
I wanted to eat it all fashionably too!

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:31.920
By consuming my Demon Jewel, the stickiness of your clothes will be the least of your worries.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.760
What are you talking about?

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:35.720
What?

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:36.550
Gah-!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.510
You're already unfashionable.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.520
Krauser-san kicks ass!

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:46.480
This movie's gotta win at least one Academy Award!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.810
What just happened?

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.690
I don't fucking believe it!
They messed with the last scene!

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:52.610
I'm sorry you two! This is all my fault!

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.900
That hit the spot! Fucking crazy movie!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:56.450
Yeees!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:56.990
Yay!

00:11:56.990 --> 00:12:00.280
And thus, the president loved "No Bire," however...

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.240
due to a court ruling brought forth by the
performing actors' respective companies,

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.870
the release date was indefinitely postponed.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.790
Postponed? Thank goodness!

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.960
Detroit Metal City!

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.590
Okay!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.430
Matsuyama Kenichi here.

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:48.600
Did you enjoy the "No Bire" movie?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.770
I hope you'll also enjoy the DMC movie.

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.350
Matsuyama Kenichi, signing out.
